            "notes": "Pick up RIP ROLL power: \n    Pros: - Once in the tire your character model disappears. Thus no dying while you drive around, so zoning tires are much better. If they ARE hunting your model, you can easily detonate tire and they cannot trade. Worst case they kill the tire, and you get a second attempt to duel them.\n              - It's great to get back to point for important fights.\n    Cons: if going against ranged enemies, think carefully about trying to reach back lines, you pop out of the tire and are in the air for a while.\n\nItems: For now just increase weapon power with blues as much as possible based on money available",
