            "notes": "At this point you do MASSIVE damage, either in snipe shots or with mine.\n\nLast items\n   Chammpion's Kit\n   Cybervenom \n\nCybervenom is partly for the heal reduction on the mines, but it also gives AP and cooldown reduction so more mines are available.\n\nThis late in the game enemies won't be as susceptible to 2 shot snipes (though keep going for them), but the zip grease mine/2 grenade combo will easily take out most heroes.\n\nThis is probably a more even split between sniping and applying tank bursts. The enemy supports will be struggling to keep the tank alive, enough to make them easier to snipe. As a final reminder though, you are a menace not because you chew through tanks, but because on a regular basis you turn and snipe someone else before supports can even respond.\n\nWhat can an enemy tank do when their DPS die all the time while they fight on the front line, only to have a junk behind or on an off angle peppering them with 400 dmg mines and 250 dmg nades?",
